  Memory
  › Memory                     [ ] Off               Whether memory is on                                                                 
    Use memories               [x] On                Whether the model may use the memories
    Generate memories          [x] On                Whether new memories are extracted from sessions
    Exclude external context   [ ] Off               A session stops contributing once it has used a web or MCP tool's output
    Extraction model           (unset)               The model that extracts memories; unset, the model policy's
    Consolidation model        (unset)               The model that consolidates them; unset, the model policy's
    Maximum source age (days)  10                    Only sessions of the last that many days are read
    Minimum idle time (hours)  6                     A session is read once it has been idle that many hours
    Sessions per pass          2                     At most that many sessions are read per pass
    Extractions consolidated   256                   At most that many extractions are consolidated
    Maximum unused age (days)  30                    ⚠ the project's value is not a number
    Memory store               Open ›                Its status, this session's contribution, and a reset


